":"xpdf_pdftotext_4_00_visual_checked_windows_data_pdf_v1","pipeline_version":null,"prior_artifact_path":"data/rag-chunks/approved/高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標_Chunks_v002.jsonl","prior_artifact_version":null,"prior_delivery_version":null,"published_at":null,"source_file":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標.pdf","source_page_updated_at":null,"source_type":"risk_rule","source_version":"112年12月22日二修","source_version_date":null,"version_published_at":null},"retrieval_policy":{"allowed_audiences":["care_professional"],"allowed_purposes":["general_information","safety_routing","evaluation"],"requires_human_review":false,"requires_official_assessment":false,"requires_professional_assessment":false,"retrieval_block_reasons":[],"retrieval_eligible":true,"risk_level":"low","stop_normal_rag":false},"schema_version":"2.0.0"}
{"artifact_version":"v001","citation":{"direct_official_source_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-78165-87c38eb9-6cd0-4bdc-a664-4315f9304dd7.html","license_evidence_url":null,"official_source_page_url":null,"physical_page_end":1,"physical_page_start":1,"printed_page_end":null,"printed_page_start":null,"publisher":"mohw","section":"指標 1 至 3","source_locator":"PDF頁 1，指標 1 至 3","storage_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ts8maIdc0KuyiKEMoNmDC5nluUQnClf3/view?usp=drivesdk","title":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標"},"content":{"char_count":297,"content_type":"table","embedding_char_count":335,"embedding_text":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標｜指標 1 至 3｜BPSD／高齡照顧者／照顧經驗｜【表格正規化】\n指標 1｜被照顧者有嚴重情緒困擾、干擾行為致難以照顧\n1. 被照顧者具行為與心理症狀(BPSD)、自傷傷人、攻擊破壞、干擾、怪異行為(例如：遊走、妄想、吼叫、發出怪聲)，照顧者因被照顧者行為產生身心壓力致無法照顧。\n指標 2｜高齡照顧者\n1. 照顧者的年齡 65 歲以上者。\n2. 原住民照顧者的年齡 55 歲以上者。\n備註：\n1. 照顧者的年齡如小於 18 歲，應優先通知照管中心進行照顧安排調整並同步通報社安網體系。\n指標 3｜過去無照顧經驗者\n1. 因家庭變故成為家庭照顧者\n2. 面對被照顧者身體狀況、病況改變(如新增壓瘡、管路或 BPSD)，而有照顧知能不足之照顧者。","embedding_text_sha256":"cfc551a1f9baa478305827e161a946ca3955a48ce27bd1b772d46abe5d3243b5","language":"zh-Hant","locale":"zh-TW","text":"【表格正規化】\n指標 1｜被照顧者有嚴重情緒困擾、干擾行為致難以照顧\n1. 被照顧者具行為與心理症狀(BPSD)、自傷傷人、攻擊破壞、干擾、怪異行為(例如：遊走、妄想、吼叫、發出怪聲)，照顧者因被照顧者行為產生身心壓力致無法照顧。\n指標 2｜高齡照顧者\n1. 照顧者的年齡 65 歲以上者。\n2. 原住民照顧者的年齡 55 歲以上者。\n備註：\n1. 照顧者的年齡如小於 18 歲，應優先通知照管中心進行照顧安排調整並同步通報社安網體系。\n指標 3｜過去無照顧經驗者\n1. 因家庭變故成為家庭照顧者\n2. 面對被照顧者身體狀況、病況改變(如新增壓瘡、管路或 BPSD)，而有照顧知能不足之照顧者。","text_sha256":"b3b963410ebe8ba64877dae398c9166009a541e4f48611dcf164b491ded21494"},"governance":{"current_status":"current","data_classification":"public","distribution_scope":"public_knowledge","embedding_status":"not_started","human_source_review":"not_completed","ingestion_status":"staging","license_status":"unknown","production_approved":false,"production_gate":"blocked","review_status":"needs_review","storage_target":"local_pending_upload","version_check_status":"pending"},"identity":{"chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_rag_v2_v001","chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_rag_v2_0002","chunk_index":2,"prior_chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_chunkset_v002","prior_chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_indicators_01_03_002","source_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222"},"provenance":{"authority_level":"official_government","chunker_version":"semantic_risk_rule_chunker_v1","is_official_source":true,"last_verified_at":null,"mapping_warnings":[],"parser_version":"xpdf_pdftotext_4_00_visual_checked_windows_data_pdf_v1","pipeline_version":null,"prior_artifact_path":"data/rag-chunks/approved/高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標_Chunks_v002.jsonl","prior_artifact_version":null,"prior_delivery_version":null,"published_at":null,"source_file":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標.pdf","source_page_updated_at":null,"source_type":"risk_rule","source_version":"112年12月22日二修","source_version_date":null,"version_published_at":null},"retrieval_policy":{"allowed_audiences":["care_professional"],"allowed_purposes":["general_information","safety_routing","evaluation"],"requires_human_review":true,"requires_official_assessment":false,"requires_professional_assessment":true,"retrieval_block_reasons":[],"retrieval_eligible":true,"risk_level":"medium","stop_normal_rag":false},"schema_version":"2.0.0"}
{"artifact_version":"v001","citation":{"direct_official_source_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-78165-87c38eb9-6cd0-4bdc-a664-4315f9304dd7.html","license_evidence_url":null,"official_source_page_url":null,"physical_page_end":1,"physical_page_start":1,"printed_page_end":null,"printed_page_start":null,"publisher":"mohw","section":"指標 4 至 6","source_locator":"PDF頁 1，指標 4 至 6","storage_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ts8maIdc0KuyiKEMoNmDC5nluUQnClf3/view?usp=drivesdk","title":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標"},"content":{"char_count":502,"content_type":"table","embedding_char_count":541,"embedding_text":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標｜指標 4 至 6｜照顧替手／照顧兩人以上／照顧能力｜【表格正規化】\n指標 4｜沒有照顧替手\n1. 負擔每週 20 小時以上主要照顧工作，無其他家人、親友或照顧資源提供協助。\n2. 受傳統文化或性別因素影響，不易求助，抗拒使用資源之照顧者或被照顧者。\n指標 5｜需照顧兩人以上\n1. 同時須照顧 2 名以上符合長期照顧、身心障礙、領有發展遲緩證明條件或尚需分配時間照顧其他家人(如照顧 3 歲以下孩童、精神病人等情事者)。\n備註：\n1. 如發現為雙老家庭(身心障礙者 35 歲以上且主要照顧者 60 歲以上)、或家有 2 名以上身心障礙者或 2 名以上精神病人，應同步通報身障或社安網體系。\n指標 6｜照顧者因疾病或身心狀況影響照顧能力或意願\n1. 照顧者具精神疾病、藥癮、酒癮或其他疾病致使照顧能力或意願受限者。\n2. 出現憂鬱、焦慮、睡眠障礙等症狀致使照顧能力或意願受限者。\n3. 照顧者持有身心障礙證明或領有重大傷病卡(含癌症)致使照顧能力或意願受限者或無法勝任照顧工作。\n備註：\n1. 疑似罹患精神疾病之人，請轉介地方政府衛生局或社區心理衛生中心。\n2. 疑似施用毒品者，請轉介地方政府毒品危害防制中心。\n3. 疑似酒精成癮者，請轉介地方政府衛生局。","embedding_text_sha256":"e45f9b6f8ccacc3649119c5a3f6dafab18051ad786757e9aa99e0678d12199d9","language":"zh-Hant","locale":"zh-TW","text":"【表格正規化】\n指標 4｜沒有照顧替手\n1. 負擔每週 20 小時以上主要照顧工作，無其他家人、親友或照顧資源提供協助。\n2. 受傳統文化或性別因素影響，不易求助，抗拒使用資源之照顧者或被照顧者。\n指標 5｜需照顧兩人以上\n1. 同時須照顧 2 名以上符合長期照顧、身心障礙、領有發展遲緩證明條件或尚需分配時間照顧其他家人(如照顧 3 歲以下孩童、精神病人等情事者)。\n備註：\n1. 如發現為雙老家庭(身心障礙者 35 歲以上且主要照顧者 60 歲以上)、或家有 2 名以上身心障礙者或 2 名以上精神病人，應同步通報身障或社安網體系。\n指標 6｜照顧者因疾病或身心狀況影響照顧能力或意願\n1. 照顧者具精神疾病、藥癮、酒癮或其他疾病致使照顧能力或意願受限者。\n2. 出現憂鬱、焦慮、睡眠障礙等症狀致使照顧能力或意願受限者。\n3. 照顧者持有身心障礙證明或領有重大傷病卡(含癌症)致使照顧能力或意願受限者或無法勝任照顧工作。\n備註：\n1. 疑似罹患精神疾病之人，請轉介地方政府衛生局或社區心理衛生中心。\n2. 疑似施用毒品者，請轉介地方政府毒品危害防制中心。\n3. 疑似酒精成癮者，請轉介地方政府衛生局。","text_sha256":"d70db4bb0305e892ed37596c3e2cf5e8435a4b6a0f168c0fd875ba81cf687405"},"governance":{"current_status":"current","data_classification":"public","distribution_scope":"public_knowledge","embedding_status":"not_started","human_source_review":"not_completed","ingestion_status":"staging","license_status":"unknown","production_approved":false,"production_gate":"blocked","review_status":"needs_review","storage_target":"local_pending_upload","version_check_status":"pending"},"identity":{"chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_rag_v2_v001","chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_rag_v2_0003","chunk_index":3,"prior_chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_chunkset_v002","prior_chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_indicators_04_06_002","source_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222"},"provenance":{"authority_level":"official_government","chunker_version":"semantic_risk_rule_chunker_v1","is_official_source":true,"last_verified_at":null,"mapping_warnings":[],"parser_version":"xpdf_pdftotext_4_00_visual_checked_windows_data_pdf_v1","pipeline_version":null,"prior_artifact_path":"data/rag-chunks/approved/高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標_Chunks_v002.jsonl","prior_artifact_version":null,"prior_delivery_version":null,"published_at":null,"source_file":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標.pdf","source_page_updated_at":null,"source_type":"risk_rule","source_version":"112年12月22日二修","source_version_date":null,"version_published_at":null},"retrieval_policy":{"allowed_audiences":["care_professional"],"allowed_purposes":["general_information","safety_routing","evaluation"],"requires_human_review":true,"requires_official_assessment":false,"requires_professional_assessment":true,"retrieval_block_reasons":[],"retrieval_eligible":true,"risk_level":"medium","stop_normal_rag":false},"schema_version":"2.0.0"}
{"artifact_version":"v001","citation":{"direct_official_source_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-78165-87c38eb9-6cd0-4bdc-a664-4315f9304dd7.html","license_evidence_url":null,"official_source_page_url":null,"physical_page_end":2,"physical_page_start":2,"printed_page_end":null,"printed_page_start":null,"publisher":"mohw","section":"指標 7 至 8","source_locator":"PDF頁 2，指標 7 至 8","storage_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ts8maIdc0KuyiKEMoNmDC5nluUQnClf3/view?usp=drivesdk","title":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標"},"content":{"char_count":202,"content_type":"table","embedding_char_count":247,"embedding_text":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標｜指標 7 至 8｜政府資源／突發緊急需求／3個月／照顧情境改變｜【表格正規化】\n指標 7｜申請政府資源不符資格、資格變動，或有突發緊急需求者\n1. 有經濟扶助需求，但因持有不動產或列計家戶人口變動等因素，而未符合政府法令致無法領取相關補助。\n2. 因突發事故無法負擔基本生活支出等。\n指標 8｜3 個月內照顧情境有改變\n1. 照顧者有急性醫療需求。\n2. 被照顧者的病況改變(如頻繁進出醫院)。\n3. 外籍看護工空窗期(如行蹤不明或轉換雇主)或其他照顧資源中斷等狀況。","embedding_text_sha256":"944443c05a892683cb59040908211942ce696d269f3b5b1204b0b6821e1271c3","language":"zh-Hant","locale":"zh-TW","text":"【表格正規化】\n指標 7｜申請政府資源不符資格、資格變動，或有突發緊急需求者\n1. 有經濟扶助需求，但因持有不動產或列計家戶人口變動等因素，而未符合政府法令致無法領取相關補助。\n2. 因突發事故無法負擔基本生活支出等。\n指標 8｜3 個月內照顧情境有改變\n1. 照顧者有急性醫療需求。\n2. 被照顧者的病況改變(如頻繁進出醫院)。\n3. 外籍看護工空窗期(如行蹤不明或轉換雇主)或其他照顧資源中斷等狀況。","text_sha256":"7f4ae575903c7c6c1be08315c6602fb85705ec4bde126da64dcd7cc7027a1f95"},"governance":{"current_status":"current","data_classification":"public","distribution_scope":"public_knowledge","embedding_status":"not_started","human_source_review":"not_completed","ingestion_status":"staging","license_status":"unknown","production_approved":false,"production_gate":"blocked","review_status":"needs_review","storage_target":"local_pending_upload","version_check_status":"pending"},"identity":{"chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_rag_v2_v001","chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_rag_v2_0004","chunk_index":4,"prior_chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_chunkset_v002","prior_chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_2023