{"artifact_version":"v001","citation":{"direct_official_source_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-78165-87c38eb9-6cd0-4bdc-a664-4315f9304dd7.html","license_evidence_url":null,"official_source_page_url":null,"physical_page_end":2,"physical_page_start":2,"printed_page_end":null,"printed_page_start":null,"publisher":"mohw","section":"指標 9 至 10","source_locator":"PDF頁 2，指標 9 至 10","storage_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ts8maIdc0KuyiKEMoNmDC5nluUQnClf3/view?usp=drivesdk","title":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標"},"content":{"char_count":195,"content_type":"warning","embedding_char_count":238,"embedding_text":"高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標｜指標 9 至 10｜家庭暴力／照顧疏忽／自殺企圖／自殺意念｜【表格正規化】\n指標 9｜照顧者或被照顧者間曾有家暴情事\n1. 照顧者自述曾對被照顧者有施暴意念或曾出現照顧疏忽，不論有無正式通報紀錄。\n2. 經評估疑似有家庭暴力或照顧疏忽情事，不論有無正式通報紀錄。\n指標 10｜照顧者曾有自殺企圖或自殺意念\n1. 照顧者過去曾有因照顧壓力而有自殺企圖、具體之自殺計畫或已準備好自殺工具等行為。\n2. 曾在言語間表達有自殺或結束自己與照顧對象生命的想法。","embedding_text_sha256":"4c54eff0332b5121bf23a961ad88c5b65ced523786be96e97b3b488c49f07a62","language":"zh-Hant","locale":"zh-TW","text":"【表格正規化】\n指標 9｜照顧者或被照顧者間曾有家暴情事\n1. 照顧者自述曾對被照顧者有施暴意念或曾出現照顧疏忽，不論有無正式通報紀錄。\n2. 經評估疑似有家庭暴力或照顧疏忽情事，不論有無正式通報紀錄。\n指標 10｜照顧者曾有自殺企圖或自殺意念\n1. 照顧者過去曾有因照顧壓力而有自殺企圖、具體之自殺計畫或已準備好自殺工具等行為。\n2. 曾在言語間表達有自殺或結束自己與照顧對象生命的想法。","text_sha256":"e56486dc785ecae8328504dc21048fe95166bcd8437cf36ec8d62b6199f9f4de"},"governance":{"current_status":"current","data_classification":"public","distribution_scope":"public_knowledge","embedding_status":"not_started","human_source_review":"not_completed","ingestion_status":"staging","license_status":"unknown","production_approved":false,"production_gate":"blocked","review_status":"needs_review","storage_target":"local_pending_upload","version_check_status":"pending"},"identity":{"chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_rag_v2_v001","chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_rag_v2_0005","chunk_index":5,"prior_chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_chunkset_v002","prior_chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_screening_20231222_indicator